I think you did not quite figure out all of the trick.  Spoiler alert:

Dig a hole in the wall of the shop.  Then dig a hole down just outside the
shop, next to the hole in the wall of the shop.  Grab what you want, run
through the hole in the wall and down through the hole in the floor.

This assumes that you have a problem surviving the cops and/or the shopkeeper.
Most of the time I end up killing hordes of Kops unless I find a shop and
something to dig with very early in the game.

